%
(Program to test M70 save/M72 restore context)
(M. Haberler)

o<print_debug> sub
(debug, incremental = #<_incremental>)
(debug, plane = #<_plane>)
(debug, work offset = #<_work_offset_number>)
o<print_debug> endsub

o1000 sub
o1001 if [#1 GT 0]
      M70 (save context)
o1001 endif
G90 G18 G91.1
G0 X5 Y20
G54.1 P20
G0 X1 Y2
o1002 if [#1 GT 0]
      M72 (restore context)
o1002 endif
o1000 endsub

G20 
G90 G90.1 G19 G55 
G53 G0 X0 Y0 Z0
G91 (relative)
g0 x10 y10
g0 x10 y10
o1000 call [1.0]
(expect restored context here)
o<print_debug> call
g0 X-5 Y-20
o1000 call [0.0]
G91 (relative)
g0 x10 y10
g0 x10 y10
o1000 call [0.0]
(expect to keep state from o1000 sub)
o<print_debug> call
%
